            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "Suppressor demand is surging, but the court ruling that removed NFA registration covers only some buyers, and DOJ is now arguing against widening it.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "DOJ filed a brief on 7 October in a Missouri NFA case opposing relief for every resident of the plaintiff states or nationwide; a status conference is set for 22 October. NSSF figures show NFA registrations up 129% year over year in September.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
